test.yaml:10:18: secret "DEPLOY_TOKEN" is passed to a reusable workflow by a job which cannot have an "environment:", so it is a repository or organization secret exposed to every job that asks for it. pass a token that the called workflow mints, let a job of the called workflow use an environment of its own, or inline the workflow in a job with an environment [secrets-outside-env]
